===Royal Navy===
The flag used by the British [[Royal Navy]] (the [[White Ensign]]) is also based on the flag of England, consisting of St George's Cross with a [[Union Flag]] in the canton.  In addition to the United Kingdom, [[White Ensign#Commonwealth of Nations|several countries]] in the [[Commonwealth of Nations]] also have variants of the White Ensign with their own national flags in the canton, with St George's Cross sometimes being replaced by a naval badge.<ref name="fotw-ensigns">{{cite web|url=https://www.fotw.info/flags/gb-enshs.html |title=United Kingdom: history of the British ensigns |publisher=Fotw.net |access-date=11 April 2010}}</ref>

